36","title":"ACC Ltd faces GST demand of Rs 59.8 crore for excess ITC claims.\nACC plans to contest the order, expecting no material financial impact.","summary":"ACC Ltd faces GST demand of Rs 59.8 crore for excess ITC claims.\nACC plans to contest the order, expecting no material financial impact.","url":"https://sqst.in/Ki8cP","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-04-11T14:59:57","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"553552","title":"Nirmal Bang sees robust demand but cautious margins for cement sector amid Q4 results.\nACC's TP cut to Rs 1,622; Ambuja's TP lowered to Rs 558 due to cost, operational challenges.","summary":"Nirmal Bang sees robust demand but cautious margins for cement sector amid Q4 results.\nACC's TP cut to Rs 1,622; Ambuja's TP lowered to Rs 558 due to cost, operational challenges.","url":"https://www.ndtvprofit.com/markets/cement-stocks-to-buy-hold-sell-ahead-of-q4-results-acc-ambuja-cements-and-more-check-nirmal-bangs-list-11299702#publisher=newsstand","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-04-02T08:38:57","source":"NDTV Profit"},{"id":"260324180189664","title":"Karnataka govt to seek legal opinion on action against ACC Ltd for ₹850 cr dues.\nDues are linked to a limestone mining lease in Chittapur taluk.","summary":"Karnataka govt to seek legal opinion on action against ACC Ltd for ₹850 cr dues.\nDues are linked to a limestone mining lease in Chittapur taluk.","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/karnataka/karnataka-govt-to-seek-legal-opinion-to-initiate-action-against-adani-groups-firm-over-850-crore-dues/article70779433.ece","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-03-24T21:52:16","source":"The Hindu"},{"id":"806900634168400640","title":"ACC reports 17% volume growth from capacity utilization and premium products.\nACC, Orient Cement, and Ambuja propose merger; cost reductions achieved in fuel, power, logistics.","summary":"ACC reports 17% volume growth from capacity utilization and premium products.\nACC, Orient Cement, and Ambuja propose merger; cost reducti